      "ELOISE: Eddie, three Gallianos. Straight up. Well?\nNOLA: To lots of years of good times. Never to be forgotten.\nFRANKI: To the group. Now and forever. And to the day we re-open in our own bar.\nELOISE: To the best friends anybody ever had.",
